      "source": "Converts the given object into a value Cassandra will be able to store natively in a column.",
      "translation": "将给定对象转换为 Cassandra 能够原样存储在列中的值。",
      "count": 6
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"ColumnTypeResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.convert\"><code>ColumnTypeResolver</code></a> to resolve <a href=\"ColumnType.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.convert\"><code>ColumnType</code></a> for properties, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>, and\n<code>values</code>.",
      "translation": "返回一个 <a href=\"ColumnTypeResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.convert\"><code>ColumnTypeResolver</code></a> 用于解析属性、<a href=\"ColumnType.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.convert\"><code>ColumnType</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a> 以及 <code>values</code> 的 <code>ColumnType</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Converts and writes a <code>source</code> object into a <code>sink</code> using the given <a href=\"../mapping/CassandraPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>CassandraPersistentEntity</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的<a href=\"../mapping/CassandraPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>CassandraPersistentEntity</code></a>将<code>source</code>对象转换为并写入到<code>sink</code>中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <code>CodecRegistry</code> registered in the <a href=\"CassandraConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.convert\"><code>CassandraConverter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回在<a href=\"CassandraConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.convert 中的接口\"><code>CassandraConverter</code></a>中注册的<code>CodecRegistry</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions</code></a> for this converter.",
