      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/projection/ProjectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>ProjectionFactory</code></a> for this converter.",
