    {
      "source": "Returns the Id for an entity. It can return:\n<ul>\n<li>A singular value if for a simple <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/annotation/Id.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>Id</code></a> or\n<a href=\"../mapping/PrimaryKey.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>PrimaryKey</code></a> Id</li>\n<li>A <a href=\"../mapping/MapId.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>MapId</code></a> for composite <a href=\"../mapping/PrimaryKeyColumn.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>PrimaryKeyColumn</code></a>\nId's</li>\n<li>A the composite primary key for <a href=\"../mapping/PrimaryKey.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>PrimaryKey</code></a> using a\n<a href=\"../mapping/PrimaryKeyClass.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>PrimaryKeyClass</code></a></li>\n</ul>",
      "translation": "返回实体的 Id。它可以返回：\n<ul>\n<li>对于简单的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/annotation/Id.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>Id</code></a> 或 <a href=\"../mapping/PrimaryKey.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>PrimaryKey</code></a> Id，返回单个值；</li>\n<li>对于复合的 <a href=\"../mapping/PrimaryKeyColumn.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>PrimaryKeyColumn</code></a> Id，返回一个 <a href=\"../mapping/MapId.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>MapId</code></a>；</li>\n<li>对于使用 <a href=\"../mapping/PrimaryKeyClass.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>PrimaryKeyClass</code></a> 的 <a href=\"../mapping/PrimaryKey.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>PrimaryKey</code></a>，返回复合主键。</li>\n</ul>",
      "count": 1
    },
